#: source/how-to/run_diff_ik.rst:4
msgid "Using a task-space controller"
msgstr "使用任务空间控制器"

#: source/how-to/run_diff_ik.rst:8
msgid ""
"In the previous tutorials, we have joint-space controllers to control the "
"robot. However, in many cases, it is more intuitive to control the robot "
"using a task-space controller. For example, if we want to teleoperate the "
"robot, it is easier to specify the desired end-effector pose rather than the"
" desired joint positions."
msgstr ""
"此前的教程使用关节空间控制器控制机器人。但在许多场景中，任务空间控制更直观。例如，遥操作机器人时，直接指定期望的末端执行器位姿，比指定各关节的位置更方便。"

#: source/how-to/run_diff_ik.rst:13
msgid ""
"In this tutorial, we will learn how to use a task-space controller to "
"control the robot. We will use the "
":class:`controllers.DifferentialIKController` class to track a desired end-"
"effector pose command."
msgstr ""
"本教程介绍如何用任务空间控制器控制机器人，使用 :class:`controllers.DifferentialIKController` "
"跟踪期望的末端执行器位姿指令。"

#: source/how-to/run_diff_ik.rst:17
msgid ""
"This tutorial uses Isaac Sim PhysX and requires an Isaac Sim installation. "
"For controller selection and the control-loop walkthrough, see "
":doc:`../concepts/motion_generators`."
msgstr ""
"本教程使用 Isaac Sim PhysX，需要安装 Isaac Sim。控制器选择和控制循环的说明见 "
":doc:`../concepts/motion_generators` 。"

#: source/how-to/run_diff_ik.rst:23
msgid "The Code"
msgstr "代码"

#: source/how-to/run_diff_ik.rst:25
msgid ""
