#: source/how-to/run_diff_ik.rst:166
msgid ""
"The script will start a simulation with 128 robots. The robots will be "
"controlled using the IK controller. The current and desired end-effector "
"poses should be displayed using frame markers. The script resets and changes"
" goals every 150 simulation steps, cycling through the poses specified in "
"the script."
msgstr ""
"脚本会启动包含 128 个机器人的仿真，由 IK 控制器控制机器人。坐标系标记会显示当前和目标末端执行器位姿。脚本每隔 150 "
"个仿真步重置机器人并更换目标，循环使用脚本中指定的位姿。"

